{"qid": "mt_00066_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0066", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 12765.48, "n_tokens": 217, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.8571, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 326, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.86", "answer": "关于分居的法律规则，结合你描述的情况，说明如下：\n\n## 一、分居与离婚的关系\n\n**《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十九条**规定：\n\n> 夫妻一方要求离婚的，可以由有关组织进行调解或者直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼。\n> 人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；如果感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\n> 有下列情形之一，调解无效的，应当准予离婚：\n> （一）重婚或者与他人同居；\n> （二）实施家庭暴力或者虐待、遗弃家庭成员；\n> （三）有赌博、吸毒等恶习屡教不改；\n> **（四）因感情不和分居满二年；**\n> （五）其他导致夫妻感情破裂的情形。\n> 一方被宣告失踪，另一方提起离婚诉讼的，应当准予离婚。\n> 经人民法院判决不准离婚后，双方又分", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 12.764, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民再461号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民再461号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏05民再1876号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏05民再1876号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪02民初1654号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪02民初1654号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民终1542号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民终1542号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民再459号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民再459号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京03民再517号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京03民再517号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）浙01民再2984号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）浙01民再2984号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）川01民初1345号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）川01民初1345号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00031_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0031", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 48.73, "n_tokens": 242, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.35, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 363, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.35", "answer": "根据你描述的情形（协商一致解除、月工资高于当地上年度职工月平均工资三倍、对计算基数与年限有争议），核心规则如下：\n\n## 一、协商一致解除，是否有经济补偿\n\n《中华人民共和国劳动合同法》第四十六条第（二）项规定：用人单位依照本法第三十六条规定向劳动者提出解除劳动合同并与劳动者协商一致解除劳动合同的，用人单位应当向劳动者支付经济补偿。\n\n也就是说，**由用人单位提出**并协商一致解除的，需支付经济补偿；若是劳动者主动提出、双方协商一致解除的，则一般无需支付。这一点在实务中常是争议焦点，需结合解除动议由谁提出判断。\n\n## 二、计算基数：三倍封顶\n\n《中华人民共和国劳动合同法》第四十七条第二款规定：\n\n> 劳动者月工资高于用人单位所在直辖市、设区的市级人民政府公布的本地区上年度职工月平均工资三倍的，向其支付经济补偿的标准", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.048, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京03民初1516号_0", "score": 0.1932, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京03民初1516号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏01民再2556号_0", "score": 0.1903, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏01民再2556号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）浙01民终2367号_0", "score": 0.1903, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）浙01民终2367号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）沪02民终1354号_0", "score": 0.1903, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）沪02民终1354号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）粤03民初2162号_0", "score": 0.1903, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）粤03民初2162号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京02民初1664号_0", "score": 0.1903, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）京02民初1664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民初2265号_0", "score": 0.1903, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）津02民初2265号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民再2132号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民再2132号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00039_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0039", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 45.91, "n_tokens": 255, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.35, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 383, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.35", "answer": "关于加班费问题，结合您提供的参考资料，说明如下：\n\n## 一、法律依据\n\n**《中华人民共和国劳动法》第四十四条**规定：\n- 安排劳动者延长工作时间的，支付不低于工资的**150%**的工资报酬；\n- 休息日安排工作又不能安排补休的，支付不低于工资的**200%**的工资报酬；\n- 法定休假日安排工作的，支付不低于工资的**300%**的工资报酬。\n\n**《中华人民共和国劳动合同法》第三十一条**规定：用人单位应当严格执行劳动定额标准，不得强迫或者变相强迫劳动者加班。用人单位安排加班的，应当按照国家有关规定向劳动者支付加班费。\n\n## 二、举证责任\n\n**《最高人民法院关于审理劳动争议案件适用法律问题的解释（一）》第四十二条**规定：劳动者主张加班费的，应当就加班事实的存在承担举证责任。但劳动者有证据证明用人单位掌握加班事实存在的证据，用人单位不提供的，", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.044, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京03民初1490号_0", "score": 0.1898, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京03民初1490号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民初2395号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民初2395号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2419号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2419号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民初1803号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民初1803号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏05民终1629号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏05民终1629号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）鲁01民再2973号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）鲁01民再2973号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）鲁01民初1954号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）鲁01民初1954号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）京03民初1278号_0", "score": 0.1837, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）京03民初1278号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00010_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0010", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 45.44, "n_tokens": 240, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.5714, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 360, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.57", "answer": "关于你所述的借款纠纷，结合你提供的参考资料，就民间借贷的法律规则说明如下：\n\n**一、借贷关系的成立与保护**\n\n合法的借贷关系受法律保护。根据参考资料中法院的裁判观点，结合借条、转账凭证及双方陈述，可以认定双方之间存在借贷合意及款项实际交付事实的，借贷关系成立。借款人应当按照约定期限返还借款。\n\n**二、关于利息**\n\n出借人主张的利率不得违反国家有关规定，超出部分不予支持。你所述月利率1%（即年利率12%），需对照合同成立时一年期贷款市场报价利率（LPR）的四倍上限判断是否受保护。\n\n依据：《最高人民法院关于审理民间借贷案件适用法律若干问题的规定》第二十五条——出借人请求借款人按照合同约定利率支付利息的，人民法院应予支持，但是双方约定的利率超过合同成立时一年期贷款市场报价利率四倍的除外。\n\n**三、需要说明", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.044, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏01民终1268号_0", "score": 0.1899, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏01民终1268号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）苏01民再2658号_0", "score": 0.1899, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）苏01民再2658号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏05民终2483号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏05民终2483号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民终2688号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民终2688号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2399号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2399号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）京03民终2848号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）京03民终2848号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）京02民再1236号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）京02民再1236号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京02民终2096号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京02民终2096号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00074_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0074", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 46.66, "n_tokens": 230, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5714, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 345, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.57", "answer": "根据你描述的情形，结合现行法律规定，分析如下：\n\n## 一、撤回离婚登记申请后的法律效果\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十七条规定了离婚冷静期制度：自婚姻登记机关收到离婚登记申请之日起三十日内，任何一方不愿意离婚的，可以向婚姻登记机关撤回离婚登记申请。撤回后，协议离婚程序即告终止。\n\n**关键点**：一方撤回申请，并不妨碍另一方通过诉讼方式主张离婚。另一方随后直接提起离婚诉讼，是合法的救济途径，法院应当依法受理。\n\n## 二、诉讼离婚的裁判标准\n\n《民法典》第一千零七十九条：\n- 人民法院审理离婚案件，**应当进行调解**；\n- 感情确已破裂、调解无效的，**应当准予离婚**。\n\n这与参考资料中法院的表述一致（如（2020）浙01民初2546号等判决均载明\"应当进行调解；感情", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.046, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）浙01民初2546号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）浙01民初2546号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2486号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2486号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民终1477号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民终1477号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏01民再2564号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏01民再2564号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）苏01民再2683号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）苏01民再2683号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民初2397号_0", "score": 0.1837, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民初2397号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）浙01民再1545号_0", "score": 0.1837, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）浙01民再1545号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）京01民初2984号_0", "score": 0.1837, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）京01民初2984号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00020_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0020", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 46.31, "n_tokens": 233, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.3571, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 350, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.36", "answer": "关于你咨询的利息规则问题，结合你描述的事实（朋友关系、银行转账119000元、无书面借款合同、未约定利息、逾期未还、主张自逾期之日起按LPR计算资金占用损失），答复如下：\n\n## 一、法律依据\n\n**1. 借款利息未约定时的处理**\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》第六百八十条第二款、第三款规定：\n\n> 借款合同对支付利息没有约定的，视为没有利息。\n> 借款合同对支付利息约定不明确，当事人不能达成补充协议的，按照当地或者当事人的交易方式、交易习惯、市场利率等因素确定利息；自然人之间借款的，视为没有利息。\n\n本案双方系自然人（朋友关系），未约定利息，故**借期内视为没有利息**，原告不能主张借期内的利息。\n\n**2. 逾期利息（资金占用损失）**\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》第六百七十六条规定：\n\n>", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.045, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民再2338号_0", "score": 0.1979, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民再2338号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏05民再1869号_0", "score": 0.1979, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏05民再1869号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民初739号_0", "score": 0.1979, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民初739号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民初2380号_0", "score": 0.1979, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民初2380号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京03民再2915号_0", "score": 0.1979, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京03民再2915号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）粤03民终2938号_0", "score": 0.1979, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）粤03民终2938号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）鲁01民终2049号_0", "score": 0.1979, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）鲁01民终2049号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京01民初2865号_0", "score": 0.1953, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京01民初2865号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00077_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0077", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 51.23, "n_tokens": 226, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5455, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 340, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.55", "answer": "根据你描述的情形（租赁期限届满后未续签书面合同、承租人继续使用并按月支付租金、出租人拟收回房屋、承租人主张优先承租权），结合你提供的参考资料，就**租金规则**答复如下：\n\n## 一、参考资料能支持的内容\n\n你提供的8份判决书（北京一中院、北京三中院、北京二中院、杭州中院、南京中院等）在\"本院认为\"部分表述基本一致，可归纳为两点：\n\n1. **合同约束力**：依法成立的租赁合同对当事人具有法律约束力。\n2. **租金支付义务**：承租人无正当理由未支付或者迟延支付租金的，出租人可以请求其在合理期限内支付。\n\n这对应的是《中华人民共和国民法典》第七百二十二条：\n\n> **《中华人民共和国民法典》第七百二十二条**：承租人无正当理由未支付或者迟延支付租金的，出租人可以请求承租", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.05, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民初2078号_0", "score": 0.1914, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民初2078号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）浙01民初2147号_0", "score": 0.1914, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）浙01民初2147号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京03民初641号_0", "score": 0.1883, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京03民初641号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏01民初1084号_0", "score": 0.1883, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏01民初1084号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再671号_0", "score": 0.1883, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再671号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京01民再2643号_0", "score": 0.1883, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）