{"qid": "mt_00058_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0058", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 51.37, "n_tokens": 228, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.7857, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 342, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.79", "answer": "根据你提供的参考资料，结合现行法律规定，就你提出的问题回答如下：\n\n## 一、起诉离婚的法定规则\n\n**1. 调解前置与准予离婚的条件**\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》第1079条规定：夫妻一方要求离婚的，可以由有关组织进行调解或者直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼。人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；如果感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\n\n参考资料中多份判决书（如（2019）闽01民终1494号、（2025）苏05民再1453号等）的裁判理由均体现了这一规则：\"人民法院审理离婚案件应当进行调解；感情确已破裂、调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\"\n\n**2. 家庭暴力属于法定准予离婚情形**\n\n《民法典》第1079条第3款明确规定，实施家庭暴力或者虐待、遗弃家庭成员的，调解无效的，应当", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.05, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1494号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1494号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1471号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1471号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民再1453号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民再1453号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京01民再2989号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京01民再2989号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民初139号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民初139号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民再2148号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民再2148号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）粤03民再288号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）粤03民再288号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏05民再2737号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏05民再2737号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00033_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0033", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 47.75, "n_tokens": 259, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.35, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 389, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.35", "answer": "关于加班费的法律规则，结合您提供的参考资料，说明如下：\n\n## 一、加班费的法律依据\n\n**《中华人民共和国劳动法》第四十四条**规定，用人单位安排劳动者延长工作时间的，支付不低于工资的150%的工资报酬；休息日安排工作又不能安排补休的，支付不低于工资的200%的工资报酬；法定休假日安排工作的，支付不低于工资的300%的工资报酬。\n\n**《中华人民共和国劳动合同法》第三十一条**规定，用人单位应当严格执行劳动定额标准，不得强迫或者变相强迫劳动者加班。用人单位安排加班的，应当按照国家有关规定向劳动者支付加班费。\n\n## 二、举证责任分配\n\n这是您案件中最为关键的问题。根据**《最高人民法院关于审理劳动争议案件适用法律问题的解释（一）》第四十二条**，劳动者主张加班费的，应当就加班事实的存在承担举证责任。但劳动者有证据证明用人单位掌握加班事实存在的证据，用人单位不提供的，", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.047, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京03民初1490号_0", "score": 0.1905, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京03民初1490号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1432号_0", "score": 0.1905, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1432号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民初2395号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民初2395号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2419号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2419号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民初1803号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民初1803号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏05民终1629号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏05民终1629号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）鲁01民再2973号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）鲁01民再2973号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）京03民初1278号_0", "score": 0.1845, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）京03民初1278号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00097_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0097", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 47.14, "n_tokens": 264, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.4545, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 396, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.45", "answer": "关于提前退租的法律规则，结合你提供的参考资料，说明如下：\n\n## 一、核心法律依据\n\n**《中华人民共和国民法典》第七百零三条**\n租赁合同是出租人将租赁物交付承租人使用、收益，承租人支付租金的合同。\n\n**《中华人民共和国民法典》第七百二十二条**\n承租人无正当理由未支付或者迟延支付租金的，出租人可以请求承租人在合理期限内支付；承租人逾期不支付的，出租人可以解除合同。\n\n**《中华人民共和国民法典》第五百七十七条**\n当事人一方不履行合同义务或者履行合同义务不符合约定的，应当承担继续履行、采取补救措施或者赔偿损失等违约责任。\n\n**《中华人民共和国民法典》第五百八十五条**\n当事人可以约定一方违约时应当根据违约情况向对方支付一定数额的违约金，也可以约定因违约产生的损失赔偿额的计算方法。约定的违约金过分高于造成的损失的，人民法院或者仲裁机构可以根据当事人的请求予以适当减少。\n\n##", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.046, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2019）浙01民终2417号_0", "score": 0.1835, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）浙01民终2417号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民再2367号_0", "score": 0.1835, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民再2367号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京01民初934号_0", "score": 0.1804, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）京01民初934号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民终2753号_0", "score": 0.1804, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民终2753号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）粤01民再1456号_0", "score": 0.1804, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）粤01民再1456号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民初2423号_0", "score": 0.1772, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民初2423号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民初2405号_0", "score": 0.1772, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民初2405号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏01民初1075号_0", "score": 0.1772, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏01民初1075号"}]}}}
